{"title":"Plume Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 31) · Monster drop: Werewolf, Moonhart, Deathstalker Scorpion, Thak Vanguard, Sirocco +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 31 <span class=\"muted\">(938 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/vulture-quill\">Vulture Quill</a>, 3× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"deathstalker-scorpion\" title=\"Deathstalker Scorpion - dropped it in 1 of 33 looted corpses (1/33)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/53fd415b972a02d5f9d9.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deathstalker Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/33<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - dropped it in 1 of 293 looted corpses (1/293)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/293<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"Sirocco - dropped it in 1 of 305 looted corpses (1/305)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/305<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonhart\" title=\"Moonhart - dropped it in 1 of 692 looted corpses (1/692)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3bc9f909e37f5929cdb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonhart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/692<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Vanguard - dropped it in 1 of 1,208 looted corpses (1/1,208)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/943cc0a6e8d1aa9dd0bd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Vanguard</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,208<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/3,778)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3,778<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"plume-feet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/vulture-quill\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/90d5c9480dcb277fd232.svg\" alt=\"\">Vulture Quill</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/f0df0a366b75220da90c.svg\" alt=\"Plume Feet\"></div><h3>Plume Feet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 31</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/6/2026, 10:14:50 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}